| '''wind_rotor_diameter''' || This parameter is populated from the particular turbine type Q-item: Set <code>{{Property|P2386}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P518}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q193466}}</code>. To override (useful for wind farms using modified turbines), set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2386}}</code>. || Height of the wind turbine towers from base to hub. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m|ft|0}}</nowiki></code> <br>If multiple types of turbines are in use, enter the maximum value.
|-
| '''wind_rated_speed''' || This parameter is populated from the particular turbine type Q-item: Set <code>{{Property|P5065}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P1013}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q64441440}}</code>. To override (useful for wind farms using modified turbines), set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P5065}}</code>. || Rated wind speed of the wind turbine model. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m/s|ft/s|1}}</nowiki></code> <br>If multiple types of turbines are in use, enter the minimum value. A [[Interval (mathematics)|range]] specifies both the cut in and the cut out speed, e.g. <code><nowiki>{{Convert|YY|-|XX|m/s|ft/s|1}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| colspan="3" style="background-color:#FFFFE6;text-align:center;" | Common information used by more than one power station type (does not generate a separate header)
|-
| '''ps_site_area''' || <code>{{Property|P2046}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P518}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q159719}}</code> || Land area used for entire facility. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|km2|mi2|0}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| '''ps_site_elevation''' || <code>{{Property|P2044}}</code> || Highest ground altitude (don't add hub height) over which a turbine is constructed. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m|ft|0}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| '''ps_chimneys''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q170477}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P1114}}</code> || Number of [[chimney]]s.
|-
| '''ps_cooling_towers''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q193886}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P1114}}</code> || Number of [[cooling tower]]s.
|-
| '''ps_cooling_source''' || {{*}}<code>{{Property|P588}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q7391292}}</code> or another subject, or<br>{{*}}<code>{{Property|P527}}</code> at <code>{{Q|Q1049799}}</code>, with qualifier <code>{{Property|P885}}</code> as the waterbody. || If the power station uses [[cooling water]], add the source of the water. For other cooling technologies, add the name of technology, e.g. "air-cooled".
|-
| '''ps_feed-in_tariff''' || <code>{{Property|P6826}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P1013}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q182098}}</code> or <code>{{Q|Q14787261}}</code> || [[Feed-in tariff]] of the power station.
|-
| '''ps_revenue''' || <code>{{Property|P2139}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P585}}</code> || Revenue for a given year.
|-
| '''ps_combined_cycle''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q900729}}</code> || Is the power station a [[combined cycle]] type? Add '''<code>Yes</code>''' or '''<code>No</code>'''.
|-
| '''ps_cogeneration''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q61867910}}</code> || Is the power station a [[cogeneration]] type? Add '''<code>Yes</code>''' or '''<code>No</code>'''.
|-
| '''ps_iwpp''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q64447720}}</code> || Is the power station an [[integrated water and power plant]]? Add '''<code>Yes</code>''' or '''<code>No</code>'''.
|-
| '''ps_iwpp_technology''' || <code>{{Property|1056}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q283}}</code>, with qualifier <br><code>{{Property|P2079}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q101017}}</code> and/or <code>{{Q|Q272175}}</code> || IWPP's water purification method. Enter any one of the following auto-expanding codes: <br><code>D</code>=[[Distillation]], <code>R</code>=[[Reverse osmosis]]
|-
| '''ps_iwpp_water_output''' || <code>{{Property|1056}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q283}}</code>, with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2197}}</code> || IWPP's maximum water output. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m3/d|ft3/d|0}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| '''ps_iwpp_water_tariff''' || <code>{{Property|2555}}</code>, with qualifiers <code>{{Property|P1013}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q1463025}}</code> and<br><code>{{Property|P2210}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q25517}}</code> || IWPP's feed-in tariff for water output.
|-
| '''ps_thermal_capacity''' || <code>{{Property|P2056}}</code> || The [[MWt|thermal power]] input in the [[thermal power station]] for conversion to [[electric power]].
|-
| '''ps_label1''' and '''ps_data1''' || <small>N/A</small> || Custom data (license information, local permit number, etc.). Supports up to 5.
|-
| colspan="3" style="background-color:#FFFFE6;text-align:center;" | '''Power generation''' (used by all power station types)
|-
| '''ps_units_operational''' || For each unit, set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> as the model of the generation unit (or unknown value), with the following qualifiers:<br>{{*}} <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> (if different from unit's standard capacity)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P571}}</code> for date construction began (or unknown value)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P729}}</code> for date unit commissioned (or unknown value)<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P730}}</code> for date unit decommissioned. 
{{Dividing line}}
For facilities with large sets of identical units (i.e. in wind farms), use qualifier {{Property|P1114}} to ''multiply'' the entry.
|| Number of currently operational turbines/generating units.
|-
| '''ps_units_manu_model''' || This parameter will be auto-populated based on <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> for <code>ps_units_operational</code>. <code>{{Property|P176}}</code> must be set in the generation unit model's Wikidata item. || Shortened name(s) of manufacturers and models of '''currently operational''' turbines/generating units.
|-
| '''ps_units_planned''' || For each unit, set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> as the model of the generation unit (or unknown value), with the following qualifiers:<br>{{*}} <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> (if different from unit's standard capacity)<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P571}}</code> for date construction began<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P729}}</code> for date unit commissioned<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P730}}</code> for date unit decommissioned. || Number of generating units currently planned/proposed for installation.
|-
| '''ps_units_cancelled''' || For each unit, set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> as the model of the generation unit (or unknown value), with the following qualifiers:<br>{{*}} <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> (if different from unit's standard capacity)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P5817}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q30108381}}</code> || Number of planned generating units cancelled.
|-
| '''ps_units_uc''' || For each unit, set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> as the model of the generation unit (or unknown value), with the following qualifiers:<br>{{*}} <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> (if different from unit's standard capacity)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P571}}</code> for date construction began (or unknown value)<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P729}}</code> for date unit commissioned<br>{{*}} Do ''not'' set <code>{{Property|P730}}</code> for date unit decommissioned. || Number of generating units under construction.
|-
| '''ps_units_decommissioned''' || For each unit, set <code>{{Property|P516}}</code> as the model of the generation unit (or unknown value), with the following qualifiers:<br>{{*}} <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> (if different from unit's standard capacity)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P571}}</code> for date construction began (or unknown value)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P729}}</code> for date unit commissioned (or unknown value)<br>{{*}} Set <code>{{Property|P730}}</code> for date unit decommissioned (or unknown value) || Number of generating units decommissioned or under decommissioning.
|-
| '''ps_electrical_capacity''' || <code>{{Property|P2109}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P459}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q200974}}</code> || Current net installed [[Nameplate capacity|capacity]] in megawatts, or planned capacity for those under development. <code>[[Megawatt|MW]]</code> suffix will auto added for values without units.<br>For those which are operational, but with additional under development, please add only the current installed value.
|-
| '''ps_electrical_cap_fac''' || <code>{{Property|P6639}}</code> || [[Capacity factor]] of the power station, in percentage as given from referenced source.
|-
| '''ps_annual_generation''' || <code>{{Property|P4131}}</code> with optional qualifier <code>{{Property|P585}}</code> || Average annual net generation. <code>[[GW·h]]</code> suffix will auto added for number without unit or text appended.
|-
| '''ps_storage_capacity''' || <code>{{Property|P4140}}</code> || [[Energy storage#Storage capacity|Storage capacity]] of the power station.
|-
| '''website''' || <code>{{Property|P856}}</code> || Official website.
|-
