|-
| '''solar_collectors_area''' || <code>{{Property|P2046}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P518}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q1379273}}</code> || Total combined surface area of heliostats or collectors. If CSP technology is of the parabolic trough or dish type, the surface given should be the aperture area.
