== Usage ==
=== Wikidata-enabled ===
Simply add <code><nowiki>{{Infobox power station}}</nowiki></code> to the top of an article belonging to any type of power station, and the data will be automatically included from [[Wikidata]]. If necessary, these values can be overridden by passing local values to the relevant parameters in the article:
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext" style="overflow:auto">
{{Infobox power station
| name = [local value]
}}
</syntaxhighlight>
To add data to Wikidata, please see the Parameters section below.

