==== Tidal power stations ====
|-
| '''tide_technology''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code> should be <code>{{Q|Q50694621}}</code>
{{Dividing line}}
<code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q7800783}}</code> or <code>{{Q|Q3250943}}</code>
|| The tidal technology in use. Enter any one of the following auto-expanding codes:<br><code>TB</code>=[[Tidal barrage]], <code>TSG</code>=[[Tidal stream generator]]
|-
| '''tide_tsg_type''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as one of the following:<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q63363573}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q63363632}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q63363679}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q63363745}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q63363781}}</code> || Type of [[tidal stream generator]]. Enter any one of the following auto-expanding codes:<br><code>HA</code>=Horizontal axis<br><code>VA</code>=Vertical axis<br><code>HF</code>=Hydrofoil<br><code>AS</code>=Archimedes screw<br><code>TK</code>=Tidal kite
|-
| '''tide_barrage_height''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q7800783}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2048}}</code> || Height of tidal barrage.
|-
| '''tide_barrage_length''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q7800783}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2043}}</code> || Length of tidal barrage.
|-
| '''tide_barrage_width''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as <code>{{Q|Q7800783}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2049}}</code> || Width of tidal barrage.
|-
| '''tide_crosses''' || <code>{{Property|P177}}</code> || Channel of water across which the barrage is build, or in which the tidal generators are located.
|-
| '''tide_channel_speed''' || <code>{{Property|P177}}</code> as the waterbody, with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2052}}</code> || Speed of water flow in the above-mentioned channel. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m/s|ft/s|1}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| '''tide_channel_volume''' || <code>{{Property|P177}}</code> as the waterbody, with qualifier <code>{{Property|P2225}}</code> || Volume discharged through the barrage. Consider using: <code><nowiki>{{Convert|XX|m3/s|ft3/s|1}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| '''tide_range''' || <code>{{Property|P4441}}</code><br> || [[Tidal range]] at the location of facility.
