|-
| '''solar_type''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code>:<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q1003207}}</code>, or<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q61950883}}</code>, or<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q285927}}</code> || The type of solar technology in use. Enter any one of the following auto-expanding codes: <br><code>PV</code>=[[Photovoltaics|Flat-panel PV]], <code>CPV</code>=[[:en:Concentrated photovoltaics|CPV]], <code>CSP</code>=[[:en:Concentrated solar power|CSP]], <code>CPVCSP</code>=Combined PV and CSP plant
