|-
| '''np_reactors''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code> should be <code>{{Q|Q134447}}</code>
{{Dividing line}}
<code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as one of the below, with qualifier as <code>{{Property|P1114}}</code>
|| Number of nuclear reactors in the power station.
|-
| '''np_reactor_type''' || <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> as one of the following:<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q377968}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q468846}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q558152}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q558181}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q319449}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q3100709}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q1204277}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q379573}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q557804}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q552334}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q1058741}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q2058283}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q1622414}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q373950}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q4391458}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q432432}}</code><br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q35957}}</code> || Type of reactor currently in use:<br>{{*}}<code>PWR</code>=[[Pressurized water reactor|PWR]]<br>{{*}}<code>BWR</code>=[[:en:Boiling water reactor|BWR]]<br>{{*}}<code>PHWR</code>=[[Pressurised heavy water reactor|PHWR]]<br>{{*}}<code>CANDU</code>=[[:en:CANDU reactor|CANDU reactor]]<br>{{*}}<code>RBMK</code>=[[RBMK]]<br>{{*}}<code>GCR</code>=[[:en:Gas cooled reactor|GCR]]<br>{{*}}<code>VHTR</code>=[[Very-high-temperature reactor|VHTR]]<br>{{*}}<code>AGR</code>=[[:en:Advanced gas-cooled reactor|AGR]]<br>{{*}}<code>GFR</code>=[[:en:Gas-cooled fast reactor|GFR]]<br>{{*}}<code>FBR</code>=[[:en:Fast breeder reactor|FBR]]<br>{{*}}<code>SFR</code>=[[Sodium-cooled fast reactor|SFR]]<br>{{*}}<code>LFR</code>=[[:en:Lead-cooled fast reactor|LFR]]<br>{{*}}<code>PBR</code>=[[:en:Pebble bed reactor|PBR]]<br>{{*}}<code>MSR</code>=[[:en:Molten salt reactor|MSR]]<br>{{*}}<code>AHR</code>=[[:en:Aqueous homogeneous reactor|AHR]]<br>{{*}}<code>AHWR</code>=[[:en:Advanced heavy-water reactor|AHWR]]<br>{{*}}<code>VVER</code>=[[VVER]].
|-
| '''np_reactor_supplier''' || Qualifier <code>{{Property|P176}}</code> on the type of reactor under <code>{{Property|P527}}</code> (see above) || Reactor supplier(s)
|-
| colspan="3" style="background-color:#FFFFE6;text-align:center;" | 
==== Solar power stations ====
|-
| '''solar_type''' || <code>{{Property|P31}}</code>:<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q1003207}}</code>, or<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q61950883}}</code>, or<br>{{*}}<code>{{Q|Q285927}}</code> || The type of solar technology in use. Enter any one of the following auto-expanding codes: <br><code>PV</code>=[[:en:Photovoltaics|Flat-panel PV]], <code>CPV</code>=[[:en:Concentrated photovoltaics|CPV]], <code>CSP</code>=[[:en:Concentrated solar power|CSP]], <code>CPVCSP</code>=Combined PV and CSP plant
