|-
| '''operator''' || <code>{{Property|P137}}</code> || Operator(s), if different from '''owner'''.
|-
| '''employees''' || <code>{{Property|P1128}}</code> with qualifier <code>{{Property|P585}}</code> || Number of employees at a given point in time.
